    "group": "Inquisitor Eisenhorn",
    "summary": "As the opponent's Shooting phase begins, pick 1 enemy **INFANTRY** unit 12\" or less from this model and **visible** to it, then roll a D6:\n\n- 1: this model takes D3 **mortal wounds**.\n- 2-5: until the phase ends, that unit's models get -1 to the **Hit roll** for their attacks.\n- 6: until the phase ends, that unit cannot shoot.",
